{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43323","headline":"潘安仁戴星看河阳花发 · 吕敞","name":"潘安仁戴星看河阳花发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行春潘令至，勤恤戴星光。\n爲政宵忘寝，临人俗冀康。\n晓花迎径发，新蘂满城香。\n秀色沾轻露，鲜辉丽早阳。\n津桥见来往，空雾拂衣裳。\n桃李今无数，从兹愿比方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}